@brief 面向 WCH（沁恒）RISC-V 单片机的 libopencm3 风格外设驱动库。

\htmlonly
<div class="libopenwch-hero">
<p class="libopenwch-hero-title">面向 WCH QingKe RISC-V MCU 的 freestanding 驱动库</p>
<p>libopenwch 在 API 风格、目录布局、构建系统和代码约定上对齐
libopencm3，同时把工具链和启动路径适配到裸机
<code>riscv64-unknown-elf</code> 环境。</p>
<div class="libopenwch-badges">
<span class="libopenwch-badge">RV32EC / RV32IMAC</span>
<span class="libopenwch-badge">C99，不依赖 newlib</span>
<span class="libopenwch-badge">LGPL-3.0-or-later</span>
<span class="libopenwch-badge">硬件验证：部分完成</span>
</div>
</div>
\endhtmlonly

